        "note": "The author's earlier Lean proof of Cabello's parity count (no_value_assignment_18_9) and of the orthogonality of the 18 vectors in R^4, inside a larger project. It does not state the theorem over all vectors, other dimensions, or complex scalars. The parity argument here is a standalone rewrite.",
