        "note": "Lean 4 and Mathlib (December 2024): FreeWillLean.kochen_specker, the theorem for all unit vectors of R^3 (no assignment with values 1, 0, 1 on every orthogonal triple, the complement of the colouring form), by a hand-written sequence of assignments, as groundwork for the Free Will Theorem. Read, not compiled. This entry is not the first formal proof in R^3.",
