        "note": "Lean 4 and Mathlib (MIT licence, November 2026): kochenSpecker_complex, the theorem in C^4 from Cabello's 18 vectors, for functions on vectors and families of four pairwise orthogonal nonzero vectors. Read, not compiled.",
