        "note": "HOL Light (John Harrison): KOCHEN_SPECKER_LEMMA, the theorem in R^3 from Peres's configuration with exact coordinates, closed by an automated case analysis (KOCHEN_SPECKER_TAC), the same architecture as dimension three here. Read, not run.",
        "relationship": "independent"
